  "description": "Nina is living on her own for the first time and failing hard at adulting. She can’t hold down any part-time jobs, let alone get hired as a full-time employee anywhere. One day, she finds a magic chest on the street that seems to make wishes come true. What started out of curiosity and fun, quickly takes a dark turn as she becomes entangled with strange people and inexplicable events. Nina will have to face the butterfly effects of her seemingly innocuous wishes!​ \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
